#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:716
msgid "Links in subscription e-mails: links to this website carry a campaign marker naming the kind of e-mail and the number of the plan, so that the web analytics (Matomo) described in this privacy policy can count visits that come from the e-mails."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:717
msgid "Links in subscription e-mails: links to this website carry a campaign marker naming the kind of e-mail, so that the web analytics (Matomo) described in this privacy policy can count visits that come from the e-mails."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:718
msgid "The marker contains neither the e-mail address nor anything else that would tie a visit to a subscriber; links with a personal access token (rating, photos, unsubscribe) carry none. The visits are processed only as that section describes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:729
msgid "Bought meal plans: whoever buys a meal plan receives a personal access code that opens the plan on this website. For each code we store a check value derived from it (not the code itself), the plan, the order number where one is noted, when it was created, and how often and when it was last used; no name and no e-mail address. The code travels in the page address; the browser also keeps it in its local storage so that the plan opens again later — it is not sent to us from there on its own (§ 25(2) no. 2 TDDDG). Failed attempts are counted per IP address in hashed form and deleted automatically after an hour. Legal basis is the purchase contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR) and, for counting failed attempts, our interest in protection against guessing codes (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR)."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: number of days.
#: includes/lib/class-mixmymeals-privacy.php:734
#, php-format
msgid "A code is kept as long as its plan; a revoked or expired code is deleted %d day later."
